# UI design

Tokens live in `frontend/src/index.css`. Use semantic Tailwind classes (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`).

## Palette

| Role | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| `primary` | Teal — CTAs, links, brand mark |
| `accent` | Soft teal wash — hovers, empty states |
| `success` / emerald | Positive balance (“owed”) |
| `destructive` | Errors / “you owe” |
| `muted` | Secondary text, settled state |

## Layout & components

- Shell: `max-w-5xl`, sticky header, mobile-friendly padding (`pb-24` for bottom reach).
- Prefer `components/ui/*` (shadcn-style) before custom primitives.
- Cards for interactive list items / forms only — not decorative chrome.
- Money: `font-mono tabular-nums` + `formatInr()` from `@/lib/format`.
- Loading: `Skeleton`; feedback: `sonner` toasts.
- Dark mode via `.dark` class + `ThemeToggle` — support both themes when adding colors.

## Copy

Short, concrete. Tagline tone: “Split bills, not friendships.” Prefer “group / expense / settle” over jargon.
